rc_Tooth_48f9a6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Lance\"><img alt=\"Obsidian Lance\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Obsidian_Lance_3ddeb8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Halberd\"><img alt=\"Halberd\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Halberd_2bb2ed.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The small peninsula east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Greenshore\">Greenshore</a> and north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> containing an <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserker</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Rider\">Orc Riders</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Spearman\">Orc Spearmen</a> and 6 <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\">War Wolves</a>. This place is perfect for mages because at <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">level</a> 27 or more they can summon a <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">monk</a>, the best monster to use there because of its constant healing. Also there are no monsters that can see <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisible\">invisible</a>. Before the Spring patch 2009 it was possible to hunt here at level 20 by luring the orc berserker and orc riders and stairhopping them.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" clas